  "sdo:name": "JPI Oceans Joint Call Blue Carbon",
  "sdo:description": "With contributions from Ireland, Canada, Germany, Malta, Norway, Poland and Greece (in-kind), JPI Oceans is launching a Joint Call on Blue Carbon Ecosystems, designed to advance research in this field. It will open for applications on 4 November 2025 with a foreseen deadline on 28 February 2026. This call will focus on expanding scientific knowledge, improving methodologies and measurement protocols, and identifying effective interventions to enhance the climate mitigation and adaptation potential of blue carbon ecosystems.",
